Then:

\text{doubleMoney} : \$10 \rightarrow \$20

is as:

\text{doubleSpeed} : 30 \rightarrow 60

They share:

T(x)=2x

A code analogy engine could search for:

function A transforms state using relationship R
find functions elsewhere that preserve R

That becomes structural code search, not keyword search.

