13. Code refrain

A repeating pattern:

connect()
read()
process()
disconnect()

appears twenty times.

That’s a refrain.

Refactor it:

def transaction(operation):
    connect()
    result = operation()
    disconnect()
    return result

You have converted refrain into abstraction.

So:

\text{repetition}
\rightarrow
\text{recognition}
\rightarrow
\text{compression}
\rightarrow
\text{function}

That is essentially the same movement as detecting a mathematical sequence rule.

